@startuml Iteration5_Drone_State_Machine
title Drone Subsystem State Machine - Iteration 5
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor<<fault>> #FFCCCC
    BackgroundColor<<offline>> #CCCCCC
}

[*] --> IDLE : Drone starts\nand registers

IDLE --> EN_ROUTE : Scheduler dispatches\nDRONE_COMMAND (TASK)
IDLE --> SHUTDOWN : DRONE_COMMAND\n(SHUTDOWN)
IDLE --> RETURNING_BASE : currentAgent < litersNeeded\n(pre-task refill)

EN_ROUTE --> DROPPING_AGENT : Arrived at zone\n(no fault)
EN_ROUTE --> FAULT_STUCK <<fault>> : DRONE_STUCK injected\n(drone freezes mid-flight)
EN_ROUTE --> FAULT_SENSOR <<fault>> : SENSOR_FAIL injected\n(arrival sensor fails)

DROPPING_AGENT --> IDLE : Drop complete\n(agent sufficient, send DRONE_RESULT)
DROPPING_AGENT --> RETURNING_BASE : Drop complete\n(remainingAgent < 10L)
DROPPING_AGENT --> FAULT_NOZZLE <<fault>> : NOZZLE_STUCK injected\n(nozzle jams during drop)

RETURNING_BASE --> IDLE : Arrived at base (0,0)\ncurrentAgent = agentCapacity\n(refill complete)

FAULT_STUCK --> RETURNING_BASE : Self-recover after 3s\n(soft fault reset)
FAULT_SENSOR --> RETURNING_BASE : Self-recover after 3s\n(soft fault reset)
FAULT_NOZZLE --> OFFLINE <<offline>> : Hard fault\n(permanent shutdown)

OFFLINE --> [*] : Drone permanently\ntaken offline

SHUTDOWN --> [*] : Drone process\nterminates

note right of FAULT_STUCK
  **Soft Fault**
  Drone stuck mid-flight.
  Scheduler re-queues zone.
  Drone self-recovers after 3s.
end note

note right of FAULT_NOZZLE
  **Hard Fault**
  Nozzle jams during drop.
  Drone goes permanently OFFLINE.
  Scheduler re-queues zone.
end note

note right of RETURNING_BASE
  **Refill Station**
  Drone returns to base (0,0).
  Agent refilled to full capacity.
  Triggered by:
  - Pre-task capacity check
  - Post-task low agent (<10L)
  - Soft fault recovery
end note

@enduml
